{"4213320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wheel Make It", "steam_appid": 4213320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One wheelchair. Two players. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel Make It is a solo or co-op physics-based game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum, friction, and collisions dictate how the wheelchair moves. Mastering balance and timing is the only way to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS OBSTACLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver through tight corridors, moving platforms, traps, and chaotic environments designed to push your coordination to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE CO-OP GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players share control of ONE wheelchair, testing your ability to sync up under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSIVE DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels ramp up in complexity, introducing new hazards and mechanics that demand sharper teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer</strong> <strong>Mode</strong>: Test your limits in a singleplayer mode, where you take the full controll of both wheels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards: </strong>Track your speed with leaderboards that compare completion times across different players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendship on the Line</strong>: Laugh, scream, and argue as you and your partner struggle to stay in sync.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Customization</strong>: Unlock and equip different skins to personalize your character.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One wheelchair. Two players. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel Make It is a solo or co-op physics-based game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum, friction, and collisions dictate how the wheelchair moves. Mastering balance and timing is the only way to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/16f2b6fcb07b175dcb3bd47f37705af1.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS OBSTACLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver through tight corridors, moving platforms, traps, and chaotic environments designed to push your coordination to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/d63734f5a10566145f90b0aa9ed7d1e0.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE CO-OP GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players share control of ONE wheelchair, testing your ability to sync up under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/7184efadba0bf21fc15d71d4027821f2.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSIVE DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels ramp up in complexity, introducing new hazards and mechanics that demand sharper teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.poster.avif?t=1787991387\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.webm?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/extras/51e5f571f797316bfadb6d1754e2b9f5.mp4?t=1787991387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer</strong> <strong>Mode</strong>: Test your limits in a singleplayer mode, where you take the full controll of both wheels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards: </strong>Track your speed with leaderboards that compare completion times across different players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendship on the Line</strong>: Laugh, scream, and argue as you and your partner struggle to stay in sync.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Customization</strong>: Unlock and equip different skins to personalize your character.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "One wheelchair. Two players. Infinite chaos. Solo or co-op physics-based game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of friendship.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Serbian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/f91565e24e6c39b9d76ee4cbeb4f5d5661820c0c/header.jpg?t=1787991387", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/2df981148a34ab56bb9ed5f3164bf3b83fe2a874/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787991387", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213320/2df981148a34ab56bb9ed5f3164bf3b83fe2a874/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787991387", "website": null, "pc_requirement